      "summary": "Comprehensive architecture guide covering the CompositionImage GPU-resident image primitive — its LoadedImageSurface lifecycle, ImageCacheService cache behavior, CrossFadeImage, and every XAML/code-behind consumer across the WaveeMusic app.",
