      "summary": "Architecture guide for every WaveeMusic UI surface that renders a track or podcast episode — covering shared row controls (TrackItem, TrackDataGrid, TrackListView, ShowEpisodeRow), all page-level track/episode lists, queue rows, search results, omnibar suggestions, home episode cards, local-file rows, and now-playing surfaces.",
      "tags": ["documentation", "architecture", "ui-component", "tracks"],
      "complexity": "complex"
    }
